# Implementation Plan: Track-Based Animation Architecture with React Gallery

**Generated**: 2025-12-08 05:45:44
**Source STATUS**: STATUS-2025-12-08-052243.md
**Spec Source**: README.md + User Architecture Decisions
**Status Reference**: All 62 animation files working perfectly; 0% track architecture implemented

