## Gap Analysis

### Current State (from STATUS-2025-12-08-052243.md)

**What Exists**:
- ✅ 62 standalone HTML animation files (all 10 techniques × logo/text × original/varied/procedural + 2 additional)
- ✅ Consistent state machine pattern across all files (entrance → hold → exit → waiting)
- ✅ Shared easing functions (duplicated but identical across files)
- ✅ Dynamic text support via postMessage in select files
- ✅ Reduced motion support (all files)
- ✅ Click-to-restart functionality (all files)
- ✅ 2,357-line index.html gallery with manual card rendering

**What's Partially Complete**:
- ⚠️ Shared utilities exist in `/animations/shared/` but not used by all files
- ⚠️ State machine logic duplicated 62 times (not extracted)

**Known Issues**:
- ❌ Procedural variants auto-restart infinitely (state machine bug)
- ❌ No automated tests (manual browser testing only)
- ❌ No error handling (silent failures on malformed SVG or missing dependencies)
- ❌ Gallery maintenance burden (30-45 min per new animation)

### Target State (from User Architecture + README.md)

**Core Architecture**:
```
Track (atomic: value over time)
  → Element (has multiple tracks, renders)
    → Animation (collection of elements, entrance/exit API)
      → toSVG() export capability
```

**Required Components**:
1. **Track System**: from, to, duration, delay, easing, getValue(t)
2. **Element Types**: LineElement, ParticleElement, BlobElement, PathElement, etc.
3. **Animation Factories**: createLineDrawingAnimation(), createParticleAnimation(), etc. (10 types)
4. **SVG Export**: exportToSMIL() generates pure SVG with <animate> tags
5. **React Gallery**: metadata-driven, track editor UI, MobX/Context state
6. **Build System**: Vite + TypeScript compilation
7. **Test Suite**: Playwright visual tests + Jest unit tests

### Gap Summary

| Component | Current | Target | Gap |
|-----------|---------|--------|-----|
| **Core Track System** | None | Track class with getValue(), easing, 8 track types | 100% missing |
| **Element Types** | Inline per file | Base Element + 6 specialized types | 100% missing |
| **Animation Factories** | 62 standalone files | 10 factory functions | 0% (factories don't exist, files do) |
| **SVG Export** | None | exportToSMIL() for all animations | 100% missing |
| **React Gallery** | 2,357-line HTML | ~500-line React app | 100% missing |
| **State Management** | Per-file inline | MobX or Context+hooks | 100% missing |
| **Build System** | None | Vite + TypeScript | 100% missing |
| **Test Suite** | None | Visual + unit tests | 100% missing |
| **Shared Utilities** | Some in `/shared/` | Fully extracted and imported | 40% complete |
| **Documentation** | README.md | API docs, examples, migration guide | 20% complete |

**Quantitative Gaps**:
- **Code Duplication**: ~80% duplicated code across animation files (easing, state machine, utils)
- **Gallery Maintainability**: 2,357 lines manual HTML → target 500 lines React (78% reduction)
- **Test Coverage**: 0% automated → target 90% visual + unit coverage
- **Build Complexity**: 0 dependencies → target Vite + pnpm ecosystem
- **Type Safety**: 0% (vanilla JS) → target 100% TypeScript

