**Spec Reference**: User Architecture → Core Layers → Element
**Status Reference**: STATUS-2025-12-08-052243.md §2.4.3 "Level 2: Element"

#### Description
Implement AnimatedElement base class with track management, update(), and render() methods.

#### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] `src/core/Element.ts` created
- [ ] AnimatedElement class has tracks: Map<string, Track>
- [ ] addTrack(property, track): adds track to element
- [ ] update(t): updates all tracks and applies properties
- [ ] applyProperty(property, value): abstract method for subclasses
- [ ] render(): abstract method for subclasses
- [ ] Unit tests: track addition, update logic
- [ ] Integration test: create element with multiple tracks, verify update

#### Technical Notes
```typescript
abstract class AnimatedElement {
  tracks = new Map<string, Track>();

  addTrack(property: string, track: Track): void {
    this.tracks.set(property, track);
  }

  update(t: number): void {
    for (const [property, track] of this.tracks) {
      const value = track.getValue(t);
      this.applyProperty(property, value);
    }
  }

  protected abstract applyProperty(property: string, value: any): void;
  abstract render(): void;
}
```

