**Quantitative**:
- Gallery code reduction: >70% (2,357 lines → <700 lines)
- Add animation time: >88% reduction (30-45 min → <5 min)
- Type coverage: 100% (no `any` types)
- Test coverage: >80% for gallery components
- Build size: <500KB initial bundle (excluding animations)

**Qualitative**:
- User can add new animation in <5 minutes
- Gallery is responsive on mobile/tablet/desktop
- All 62 animations load and play correctly
- Parameter editor works for procedural animations

---

### Phase 2: Track System (If Proceeding)

**Quantitative**:
- Code duplication reduction: >80% (60 animation files)
- Performance: <5% regression vs original (60fps maintained)
- Track overhead: <1ms per getValue() call
- Memory: No leaks after 100 restart cycles
- Test coverage: >90% for track system

**Qualitative**:
- New animation creation: <1 hour (vs current ~3-5 hours)
- Config hot-swap works smoothly (no destroy/recreate)
- Dynamic text updates work without breaking animations
- SVG export produces valid, playable SVG files

