### ⚠️ May Change (If Proceeding to Phase 2)

**Animation Files**: If migrating to track system, animations become factories or generated HTML

**Build Process**: Add Vite + TypeScript compilation, pnpm scripts

**Deployment**: Static hosting still works, but now includes build step

